#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:245
msgid "Set comprehensions: `SELECT DISTINCT`"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:247
msgid "Curly brackets make a **set** - the unique values (session 3):"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:261
msgid "Dictionary comprehensions, with `{key: value for ...}`, are in session 6."
